   "source": [
    "## 4. Define all 10 classification algorithms\n",
    "Part A = models 1–5 (Review 1), Part B = models 6–10 (Review 2). All use the **same** split and `random_state=42`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "e2c15399",
