    "## 5. Train & evaluate all 10 algorithms (same test set)\n",
    "Metrics: Accuracy, Precision / Recall / F1 (**weighted**), ROC-AUC (**One-vs-Rest** for multi-class), confusion matrix."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "29f5106a",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-20T10:18:13.470432Z",
